      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> We can reference :\n    ° a Pre-Existing Image, \n    ° an Image that is built by the developer,\n    ° an Image that you acquire from a trusted vendor :\n        - like Red Hat",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> We can reference :\n    ° a Pre-Existing Image, \n    ° an Image that is built by the developer,\n    ° an Image that you acquire from a trusted vendor :\n        - like Red Hat",
      "autoResize": true,
