      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> The Deployment specifies the properties with which\n    your Pods are going to be instantiated :\n    It can specify things like :\n        ° an Image\n\n\n        \n        ° health checks\n\n\n\n\n        ° Environment Variables \n\n        ° ... ",
